WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.030
C...

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:06.290
Cosmic!

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.930
I... I'm...

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:08.730
I'm in... l...

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:09.530
...I...

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.800
...I... l...

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.190
"l...?"

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.520
l...

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.300
Kasuga... I've been waiting for you...

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.690
I'm... I'm gonna be...

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.400
I'm done!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.810
Chug! Chug! Chug!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.030
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.920
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.060
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.830
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:37.800
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.940
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.810
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.780
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.950
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.890
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:25.820
One Snow-White Night!
Two, Alone inside a Gondola!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.300
Madoka!

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:46.310
Hi!

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:57.260
So that's the best you can do, eh?!

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.320
Sempai!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.760
A straight descent!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.270
It's a Sunday, not many days
away from graduation.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.110
Because Komatsu tricked me
by insisting that...

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:11.720
