00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.360
Hey!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.720
Okay then, tonight...
Hey!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:39.800
Hey!

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.310
...I'll make sure you're alone with her.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:44.450
Can't be...

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.700
Thank you God!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.130
Wh...Wh...Whoa...

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.330
Oh! Very good! Very good!

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:58.990
That's my Sempai!
You learn so much so fast!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.180
Do I, really?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.550
