00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.430
Wanna go dancing with me?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.080
When are you going to get off me?!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.910
What? Oh!
When are you going to get off me?!

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:33.990
When are you going to get off me?!

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:36.920
Gee... Don't make me panic like that!

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.960
