00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.260
Er... To cheer things up around here...

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:49.920
Hikaru will now chug her juice!

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:55.440
C'mon now! "We can enjoy our drinks today...

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.380
