00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.930
Yeah... I sure wish
somebody would notice us...

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.510
Me too.

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:09.910
I know! Kazuya!

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:11.880
I can't use telepathy, but...

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.350
...if I concentrate really hard, and call his name...

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:16.980
Kazuya, hear me...!

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:18.840
Kazuya!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.690
Kazuya!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.090
Hey, Kazuya!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.410
If I die, my ghost will haunt you!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.420
Only a dream... Boy, that was scary...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.980
Oh? He's not back yet? Oh well...

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:38.070
