00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.330
Huh?
I'm sorry.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.430
Oh, er...
Huh?

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:45.510
Oh, er...

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:47.300
...it's all because I wanted to ride on this thing.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.610
No... It's all right.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.970
Ayukawa...

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:56.850
If it ain't gonna make you feel all that great...

00:19:56.850 --> 00:20:00.060
...when you settle for
less than you bargain for...

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:05.320
...just believe in all the power that you've got...

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:05.920
All right!
...just believe in all the power that you've got...

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:06.390
"Night & Day"
All right!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.670
"Night & Day"

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:12.840
Dance! Dance!

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:16.990
There's no need for words...

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:30.590
Ayukawa! Don't fall asleep! Ayukawa!

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:33.690
Kasuga... I'm sleepy...

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:35.750
Ayukawa! Hey! Ayukawa!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.390
Ayukawa!

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:45.070
I've got no choice,
I've got to teleport us...

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.100
...or at least, Ayukawa...

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.540
My Power isn't working!

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:54.260
Dammit!

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:01.920
Kazuya... Hear me!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.290
You're my cousin, aren't ya?!

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:06.920
We're dying out here!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:10.560
I've run out of Power...

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:12.590
You're... my only hope...

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:17.350
Kazuya... Kazuya...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.290
Are you awake now?

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:56.970
How... did I get here...

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:58.480
That was a close call!

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:01.130
You two could've frozen to death, y'know!

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:03.000
Kasuga!

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:10.790
Well, I'm gonna go wash up now.

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:13.820
Take your time!

00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:18.390
Kasuga...

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:24.330
Where... am I?!

00:22:24.330 --> 00:22:27.630
It could be that... God saved us.

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.010
Or...

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:32.040
...maybe we're in Heaven?

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:43.310
So, we meet again.

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:51.230
K...Kazuya, why that brat!

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:54.220
I've been awakened by a wet bed!

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:57.240
Wait, you! Kazuya!

00:22:57.240 --> 00:22:58.810
Oh! I'm sorry!

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:00.970
Hey, you!

00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:03.470
Hold it, you!

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:05.730
You're not gonna get me to
take the rap for that! No way!

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:09.170
An apology won't get you off the hook!

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:12.220
Kazuya!

00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:14.140
Darling!

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:18.160
Where have you been?!

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:20.380
Huh? Er... Er, well...

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:21.880
Oh, I'm so sorry!
Huh? Er... Er, well...

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:22.710
Huh?
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:22.790
Huh?

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.600
I hung out with some other guys!

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:28.300
But I didn't have an affair!

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:30.350
Please forgive me...!

00:23:50.010 --> 00:23:58.530
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:02.400
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:14.110
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:19.880
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.880 --> 00:24:28.230
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.230 --> 00:24:35.760
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.760 --> 00:24:43.410
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.410 --> 00:24:51.050
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:51.050 --> 00:24:58.590
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.590 --> 00:25:04.610
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.230 --> 00:25:15.260
The first love that's been on Ayukawa's mind...

00:25:15.700 --> 00:25:17.440
I wanted to find out just who it was...

00:25:17.440 --> 00:25:20.180
...so I've time-traveled
six years into the past!

00:25:20.180 --> 00:25:22.250
But, h...how was I supposed to know...

00:25:22.250 --> 00:25:25.950
...that I'd be there to
witness her kissing him?!

00:25:25.950 --> 00:25:30.040
Next time: "A Presentiment of Farewells. Locate Madoka's First Love."
